# mbsync: nasr@nsrddyn.com <-> ~/Mail/nsrddyn  (run: mbsync nsrddyn)
# Password comes from the keyring:
#   secret-tool store --label="Mail nsrddyn.com" service mail host mail.nsrddyn.com user nasr

IMAPAccount nsrddyn
Host mail.nsrddyn.com
Port 993
User nasr
PassCmd "secret-tool lookup service mail host mail.nsrddyn.com user nasr"
TLSType IMAPS
AuthMechs LOGIN

IMAPStore nsrddyn-remote
Account nsrddyn

MaildirStore nsrddyn-local
Path ~/Mail/nsrddyn/
Inbox ~/Mail/nsrddyn/INBOX
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel nsrddyn
Far :nsrddyn-remote:
Near :nsrddyn-local:
Patterns *
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *
CopyArrivalDate yes
